## A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects
## including temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular .NET tools. If you are
## developing with Visual Studio, the VS .gitignore
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore
## has more thorough IDE-specific entries.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

# Per-machine build overrides (copy Local.props.sample -> Local.props; see build/GamePaths.props)
/Local.props

# Agent/developer scratch: verification builds, baseline worktrees, throwaway experiments. Untracked but
# deliberately inside the repo so lingering stale files are visible. Safe to delete wholesale at any time.
/.scratch/

# Vendored binary dependencies (build/tools/vendor.py): the game's licensed assemblies, per releasable unit and
# version. NEVER commit or publish anything under this tree — the repo is public and these files are not ours to
# redistribute. See .ai/f5b-game-assembly-packages.md §2.
/vendor/

# Restored game-assembly package trees (#23): the same licensed content as vendor/, restored from the private
# feed into the layout the build resolves declared versions from (packages/7dtd.assemblies.<unit>/<version>/).
# NEVER commit or publish anything under this tree.
#
# DELIBERATELY REDUNDANT with the boilerplate [Pp]ackages/ rule in the build-results block below: licensed
# files must not depend on generic boilerplate surviving a cleanup, so this rule stays even though that one
# currently shadows it (last match wins — `git check-ignore -v` credits the boilerplate line while both exist).
/packages/

# Claude Code local memory, including backups (memory-backup-<date>) from the /dream skill
.claude/memory/
.claude/memory-backup-*/

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
[Pp]ackages/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# Common IntelliJ Platform excludes
# https://github.com/JetBrains/resharper-rider-samples/blob/master/.gitignore

# User specific
**/.idea/**/workspace.xml
**/.idea/**/tasks.xml
**/.idea/shelf/*
**/.idea/dictionaries
**/.idea/httpRequests/

# Sensitive or high-churn files
**/.idea/**/dataSources/
**/.idea/**/dataSources.ids
**/.idea/**/dataSources.xml
**/.idea/**/dataSources.local.xml
**/.idea/**/sqlDataSources.xml
**/.idea/**/dynamic.xml

# Rider
# Rider auto-generates .iml files, and contentModel.xml
**/.idea/**/*.iml
**/.idea/**/contentModel.xml
**/.idea/**/modules.xml

*.suo
*.user
.vs/

Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
